Name: surveyframe: Design an instrument
Description: Open the client-side SurveyBuilder to design a questionnaire and analysis plan.
Binding: addin_launch_builder
Interactive: true

Name: surveyframe: Open analysis workspace
Description: Open SurveyStudio to preview an instrument, load responses, run analyses, and export reports.
Binding: addin_launch_studio
Interactive: true

Name: surveyframe: Analyse an existing instrument
Description: Choose an .sframe file and open SurveyStudio at the response-loading step.
Binding: addin_launch_dashboard
Interactive: true

Name: surveyframe: Insert starter instrument
Description: Insert a valid questionnaire, scale, and reliability-plan template in the active R script.
Binding: addin_insert_skeleton
Interactive: false
